<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Capps, Jerry: Lapidary J, Feb 95, p120</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Does not have optional "accent" facets (See 45.077A)</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="284">but does have unpolished C3,C5 facets</text>
